{"ID":"20240314092239-6snni2w","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240314092239-6snni2w","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240314092239-6snni2w\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422160802-xkdh124\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422160802-rsvz9p2\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422160802-rsvz9p2\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:110,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:110\u0026#125;","title":"【酸枣仁汤】","type":"doc","updated":"20240422160802"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240422160802-xkdh124","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240422160802-xkdh124","updated":"20240422160802"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"虚劳虚烦不得眠，酸枣仁汤主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240422160802-eojup93","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422160802-eojup93","updated":"20240422160802"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"酸枣仁汤方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422160802-yuy7vrd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422160802-yuy7vrd","updated":"20240422160802"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"酸枣仁二升\t甘草一两\t知母茯苓各二两\t芎藭一两"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422160802-2gcb9i2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422160802-2gcb9i2","updated":"20240422160802"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右五味，以水八升，煑酸枣仁，得六升，内诸药，煑取三升，分温三服。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422160802-uu1a8a4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422160802-uu1a8a4","updated":"20240422160802"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我们继续看这个：“"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"虚劳虚烦不得眠，酸枣仁汤主之。"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"”大家看到失眠的一个处方了哦，酸枣仁汤是很有名的一个治疗失眠的处方，那用在什么时候呢？"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"第一个，用在年龄大的人"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，老人家哦，失眠。年龄大的人呢有虚劳，身体会衰弱下去嘛，产生的失眠呢，这个就是我们这个酸枣仁汤。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"第二个，大病初愈的人"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，病人刚刚恢复体力，恢复病情的时候，病情恢复了，刚刚好，病好的时候没有办法睡觉，这都是属于酸枣仁汤证哦。"}]},{"ID":"20240422160802-6347107","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422160802-6347107","updated":"20240422160802"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那这个酸枣仁怎么来的，诸位看酸枣仁，顾名思义就是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"酸，就是入肝"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。酸味的呢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"除了入肝以外主的是收敛"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，所以呢酸枣仁可以把血收敛回肝脏。肝藏魂，所以当你如果血没有办法回到肝脏的时候，魂就在外面没有办法回到肝脏里面，晚上就不好睡。最明显的呢就是 1 点到 3 点钟都不能睡觉。那 1点到 3 点，诸位如果你发觉到你的亲人，听了我们针灸以后，很紧张，因为 “糟糕，他 1 点到 3 点钟不能睡觉。”你不要急哦，没那么坏，先问他症状。"}]},{"ID":"20240422160802-z99nlkd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422160802-z99nlkd","updated":"20240422160802"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"任何人的实证出现的时候，他会有痛，任何的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"实证出来痛呢是持续性的痛"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。那如果是虚证的话，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"虚也会有痛啊，但是是隐隐作痛"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，不是持续的。所以如果是隐隐作痛，它是虚呀，你不要紧张啊，老师，他都 1 点到 3 点都睡不着，老师你都说 2 年以后会得肝癌，这都吓死了。对不对，那我们还没有开始动手他就吓昏了，也不对，所以说你不要紧张，不要紧张。"}]},{"ID":"20240422160802-zey4wia","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422160802-zey4wia","updated":"20240422160802"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那你看到酸枣仁的时候，我们知道这个酸枣仁可以把血，让他血回到肝脏里面。你看那知母，我一再跟诸位说"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"知母是除烦"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的，因为知母能入肺，能够除烦。那手足躁扰，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"晚上烦得不能睡觉，都可以加知母进去啊，那好像抗忧郁药一样"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"啊。茯苓呢啊和川芎，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"茯苓呢入三焦系统"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，哦，能够把这个，三焦系统的水排出来啊。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"川芎呢是活血化瘀"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。这几种药混在一起的时候啊，这个可以补虚劳，比如川芎啊、茯苓啊。"}]},{"ID":"20240422160802-tqwu5e0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422160802-tqwu5e0","updated":"20240422160802"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我们一般来说，开滋补的药的时候哦，我们不会开得很强。你如果开，比如说他是要睡觉嘛不能睡觉，那你说好，老师，他这个人不能睡觉，我给他开这个当归，熟地，他本来就不能睡，开了那么多补的药，他精神更好啊。所以我们的观念里面是，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"经方在治疗失眠时是消导，并不是说去强补啊"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，因为他已经是不能睡觉了，你一强补他，反而他更不能睡啊。所以用消导的方式，让他心情平稳下来，让他血和水呢能够慢慢循环非常好，酸枣仁让他血回到肝脏里面去，一点甘草，让它中和它。"}]},{"ID":"20240422160802-tq9vadn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422160802-tq9vadn","updated":"20240422160802"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这几味药呢，先煮酸枣仁，再去煮其他的药，这是一个很有名的治疗失眠的方子。"}]},{"ID":"20240422160802-rsvz9p2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422160802-rsvz9p2","updated":"20240422160802"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"过去呢诸位有学过我们的黄连阿胶汤，也是治疗失眠的方子，但是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"黄连阿胶汤呢是心血不足"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，所以用阿胶，这个心血不足呢为什么不能睡觉？因为心藏神，所以这时候我们用黄连阿胶汤，那神不守的话也是不能睡眠啊。这是我简单讲个例子给你们听。"}]}]}